# KESWA WEAR - Neon PostgreSQL Database Configuration
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Connect your database named "keswawear" on Neon (https://neon.tech):
# In Vercel Project Settings -> Environment Variables, add:

DATABASE_URL=postgresql://keswawear_owner:YOUR_PASSWORD@ep-YOUR-PROJECT.us-east-2.aws.neon.tech/keswawear?sslmode=require
POSTGRES_URL=postgresql://keswawear_owner:YOUR_PASSWORD@ep-YOUR-PROJECT.us-east-2.aws.neon.tech/keswawear?sslmode=require

# When using the native Vercel Neon Marketplace integration, Vercel automatically populates DATABASE_URL and POSTGRES_URL.
# When deployed to Vercel, the application automatically syncs products, site content, and orders directly to Neon!
